{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a8005ec1a6393dfabf8212f0bfbe19be4538fbbab9d9938ed9e16e185c4cc472", "ja": "個性豊かな仲間たち", "zh": "个性丰富的伙伴们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2e5c7717dae62862326dfc6b24fdef31c35ab53243db0a46651d543e7ff60b51", "ja": "劇場の個性的な仲間たちのことを、かるたの\nようだと例えるエミリー。それを聞いた美也\nは、実際にみんなの情報をかるたにして覚え\nようと閃く。恵美はそのアイディアに乗り、\nデザインが得意なロコに声をかける。", "zh": "艾米莉把剧场里个性十足的伙伴们比作歌留多。听了这话的美也灵机一动，决定真的把大家的信息做成歌留多来记忆。惠美也赞同这个想法，向擅长设计的ROCO搭话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "d63c111ee1adb61e99dc99a8e15a8e10818cff135c539fb341db6891ddf01d46", "ja": "コンコン……ガチャッ", "zh": "咚咚……咔哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "730de41e030e840e7e775f5c6c83521bf2e57542362f528f3abdcfa7836d5eb1", "ja": "お邪魔します～。\n……おお～、これはまた、綺麗な部屋ですな～。", "zh": "打扰了～。\n……哦～，这房间还真是漂亮啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "99198bb4ed43dfd5e0271c668c3705daf6ea4650dc63a7bc738026a81d2a0228", "ja": "ここが身支度部屋ですね。\n広くて立派で、とても使いやすそうです♪", "zh": "这里就是梳妆室吧。\n又宽敞又气派，看起来非常好用呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "a2576f9d58ffbfb3c55dbb3c8c80738a87ca6410fb82f9afcb629e4ceeac0786", "ja": "鏡も大きいし、メイクもコーデも超はかどるヤツ！\nもうここにみんなで住んじゃえばよくない？", "zh": "镜子也很大，化妆和搭配都超方便！我们干脆都住在这里不就好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "53e18b7b34435bc1dc25040d428db898610c505ac799d6ff896108d6f200eb2b", "ja": "はっ。そういえば、日本の僧侶の方々も、\nお寺にお住まいになりながら修行に励みます！", "zh": "啊，对了，日本的僧侣们也会住在寺庙里修行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "7b53852ff9432a7978d13bac1c2829166aa1eb44f2c235a8a95e1fc680109825", "ja": "あはは、修行もいいんだけど……。ほら、みんなで\nお泊りしたら、顔覚えるのも早いでしょ？", "zh": "啊哈哈，修行也是挺好的啦……不过你看，大家一起留宿的话，不是也能更快记住彼此的长相嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "09881441f8c31e231237e6434bdf88efdf37b8e79278ce93fa92540da45befb7", "ja": "そういえば、おふたりはもう、\n他のメンバーのみなさんには会えましたか～？", "zh": "这么说来，两位已经和其他成员们见过面了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "8a424fcd0e6ce00337e878568c0614c512421b32e3e5c5211aa7ba0e82a7ff0f", "ja": "うん、レッスンで何人かね。\nそうそう、メッチャしっかりした小学生がいてさ！", "zh": "嗯，在课程上见到了几个。\n对了，有个特别靠谱的小学生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "4195dae7c4de904785abbb0abc4d0fa3abd62068c0846478506a6921d2dcef0c", "ja": "たしか、中谷育って子。レッスンルームの鍵返す場所\nとか、いろいろ教えてくれたんだよ♪", "zh": "好像是个叫中谷育的孩子。她还教了我像练习室钥匙要放在哪里之类的好多事情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "e42c8e756bc7565a6131553df70e7f0f03dc860c8adc1fcf891d0098812ed58e", "ja": "私もいろいろな方とお会いしました！\nみなさん、素敵な大和撫子の方ばかりで……。", "zh": "我也见到了许多位！大家全都是优秀的大和抚子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "661fb838359df4f60a3a1397c40708c094fdbc9e581b12068aa4fc4afc211c95", "ja": "艶やかな黒髪が美しい北上麗花さん、舞がとてもお上手\nな舞浜歩さん、野球がお得意な永吉昴さん……。", "zh": "有着美丽乌黑秀发的北上丽花、舞跳得非常好的舞滨步、擅长打棒球的永吉昴……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "5cadfb2f7690e9822ac49cba19b13f0554539356f3df8772192334a737626722", "ja": "私もいろいろです～。ギターが上手なジュリアちゃん\nとか、とっても賑やかな茜ちゃんとか～。", "zh": "我这边也各式各样呢～。有擅长弹吉他的茱莉亚，还有特别热闹的小茜～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "4ad3f1d700311b5c998cdaf2cffee640709c43124891b62b3a306b4c9190488f", "ja": "まだ半分も会えてないし、名前覚えるだけで大変そう\nだけど……。なんか面白い子ばっかだよね！", "zh": "还没见到一半的人，光是记住名字就够辛苦了吧……不过，感觉尽是些有趣的孩子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "b26617c191a5d4d4f3d8bc5a2ad964892ebe61dd49b96948a7f7129ca52d5a57", "ja": "はい！　皆さんきらびやかで、色とりどりで……。\nまるで、かるたのようです。ふふっ♪", "zh": "是的！大家都光彩夺目、五彩缤纷……简直就像歌牌一样。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "e7c05bbee6c173c3bb04ead7ab5017fa6b956d82d2c8ebf7a07274b12a86c28c", "ja": "かるた？　へえ～、エミリーってほんと日本に\n詳しいよね。アタシより超大和撫子じゃん！", "zh": "歌牌？哇～，艾米莉真的很了解日本呢。简直比我还像大和抚子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "b2f3a35302c475493bad96eb381966ea03e856b785de44e5b29a47d17f9288c8", "ja": "と、とんでもありません！\n私なんてまだまだ未熟者で、皆様のようにはとても……", "zh": "不、不敢当！\n我还差得远了，实在无法和大家相比……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "9caf30823bb97796bdad3a101ab60e667067f8c2429c5139be984a86d86dcdfa", "ja": "お～。エミリーちゃんのおかげで、\nいいことを思いつきました～。", "zh": "哦～多亏了艾米莉，我想到一个好主意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "818992bddf461a870640a163a8fe1004ec54b842c2f795a62989e855b5964318", "ja": "私たちのかるたを作ってみませんか～？\n名前と特徴を調べて、読み札と取り札を作るんです～。", "zh": "要不要试着做一套属于我们的歌留多呀～？\n调查大家的名字和特点，然后做出读牌和取牌～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "b6544a53fbdde666193f54e1fb23cf38f2badf6cfcc82c9a8b8f791482d42a83", "ja": "みんなのことも分かりますし、作ったかるたで\n遊ぶうちに、名前も覚えられますよ～。", "zh": "不仅能增进对大家的了解，在玩做好的歌留多时，\n还能记住大家的名字哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "827e0d6efcec2ad2110cac0937bf1811dc7cd6edffd1c7e305a7a84fd39e6f0f", "ja": "Wow！　私たちのかるた……！\nとっても、とっても素敵だと思います！", "zh": "Wow！属于我们的歌留多……！\n我觉得非常、非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "735e4c9f1c91f0e001ae7d288c1cccc2632c0ef376d49e79f81da319cd4c9806", "ja": "いいじゃん、面白そう♪　あ、そういうの作るの、\nめっちゃ得意そうな子がいるかも。ちょっと待ってて！", "zh": "不错嘛，感觉很有意思♪ 啊，说到做这种东西，可能有个特别擅长的孩子。等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "30fddc7bfa853435c37c863d6f5d45909a4d372c6fdbe2d55d820bb4a48812cb", "ja": "ええと……ロコに何か用ですか？　新作ロコアートの\nコンセプト作りで、いま忙しいんですけど……。", "zh": "呃……找ROCO有什么事吗？我现在正忙着为新作ROCO艺术构思概念呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "722bddcb63aec67b0298205af1e3a0c4a4a109b7c5ddb6972cf4d0dcd015bc90", "ja": "おお～、誰を呼んでくるのかと思えば、\n伴田さんでしたか～。", "zh": "哦哦～我还在想你要叫谁来呢，原来是伴田小姐呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "4c2bddfcca0131f49771d598b7c17782c6b880a1638feebe4323d7746d8cc34e", "ja": "むむむ……。ロコはロコです！\nロコと呼んでくださいね！", "zh": "唔唔唔……。ROCO是ROCO！\n请叫我ROCO哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "dfc9075663f53593961440942dd4a11c54fc3052456174d3eaf3803d1c4439fd", "ja": "うん、でね、ロコってデザインとか得意なんだよね？\n話だけでも聞いてくれない？", "zh": "嗯，还有啊，ROCO很擅长设计之类的对吧？\n能不能先听我说说看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "0b179b3d02b2ff3c1eee12ca90e304603274565ad504d8dbae20829d701034dc", "ja": "デザイン……？", "zh": "设计……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "c8c5099140e459c4d13fdee95ed8eb075bb689a2cdb34eb877f0c86a7ee798f3", "ja": "インタレスティングです！\nカルタ……トラディショナルなアプローチですね♪", "zh": "很有意思！\n歌牌……真是传统的做法呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "36434401fdf8c6a46f041c99c0dd24684cd751b5177110cea42d5101ab7cf3d5", "ja": "わかりました、ロコもジョインします！\nいくつかラフデザインを出しますから、見てください！", "zh": "明白了，ROCO也会加入！\n我会拿出几份草图设计，请看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "47bdfc9e8e0c4893918bce84668d3e943ab481ee7e77c2f047581168a032bea0", "ja": "すごいです！　この劇場には本当に、\nいろいろな方がいらっしゃるのですね！", "zh": "好厉害！这个剧场里真的有形形色色的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "c32fdf3872f2b732b4ae92a9b4547e40c44c609cfef9317e2d8faca93f21b935", "ja": "み、みんな、もう仲良くなって……楽しそう……。\nわ、私も、勇気を出して……！", "zh": "大、大家，都已经打成一片了……看起来好开心……\n我、我也要，鼓起勇气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0300_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0300_story_02_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "f63b3ecfc2fd90b17b2a0989d37d22e8a760fc4038d0cfe0d2913c0f1277d1f8", "ja": "……。\nうう、やっぱり、明日から……。", "zh": "……。\n呜呜，还是……明天再说吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
